### Description

List existing IP whitelist records by page. The caller must have permission to manage the IP whitelist.

Records can be filtered by IP, business, action scope, creator, and last modifier, with paging and sorting. When paging is omitted, the query starts at offset 0 and returns 10 records. length must be from 1 to 200. A value less than 1 or greater than 200 is a parameter error. This API does not return the full result set in one request.

### Request Parameters

#### Body Parameters

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|------|------|------|------|
| ip | string | No | Comma-separated IPv4 values. Matches saved IPv4 addresses by fuzzy search. Empty or omitted means no IP filter |
| scope_list | array | No | Exact filter by business. Multiple businesses are combined with OR. Empty or omitted means no business filter. Only businesses bound on the record are matched. A record that applies to all businesses is not included when filtering a single business |
| action_scope_list | array | No | Exact filter by action scope. Multiple values are combined with OR. Empty or omitted means no action-scope filter. Allowed values: SCRIPT_EXECUTE (script execution), FILE_DISTRIBUTION (file distribution) |
| creator | string | No | Creator, fuzzy match. Empty or omitted means no creator filter |
| last_modifier | string | No | Last modifier, fuzzy match. Empty or omitted means no modifier filter |
| start | long | No | Start offset, beginning at 0. Defaults to 0 when omitted. A value less than 0 is a parameter error |
| length | long | No | Page size. Defaults to 10 when omitted. Only 1 to 200 is allowed. A value less than 1 or greater than 200 is a parameter error and is not rewritten to another page size |
| order_field | string | No | Sort field. Allowed values: last_modify_time (last modification time), last_modifier (last modifier). When omitted, records are sorted by last modification time descending and order is ignored |
| order | long | No | Sort direction. Allowed values: 0 (descending), 1 (ascending). Used only when order_field is set. Defaults to 0 when omitted. Any other value is a parameter error |

##### scope_list[] element

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|------|------|------|------|
| bk_scope_type | string | Yes | Resource scope type. Allowed values: biz (business), biz_set (business set), tenant_set (tenant set) |
| bk_scope_id | string | Yes | Resource scope ID corresponding to bk_scope_type. It is a business ID, business set ID, or tenant set ID. A scope that does not exist is a parameter error |

##### action_scope_list[] element

| Field | Type | Required | Description |
|------|------|------|------|
| (element) | string | Yes | Action scope. Allowed values: SCRIPT_EXECUTE (script execution), FILE_DISTRIBUTION (file distribution) |

### Request Example

- POST

```json
{
    "ip": "127.0.0.1,127.0.0.2",
    "scope_list": [
        {
            "bk_scope_type": "biz",
            "bk_scope_id": "2"
        },
        {
            "bk_scope_type": "biz_set",
            "bk_scope_id": "3"
        }
    ],
    "action_scope_list": [
        "SCRIPT_EXECUTE",
        "FILE_DISTRIBUTION"
    ],
    "creator": "admin",
    "last_modifier": "admin",
    "start": 0,
    "length": 10,
    "order_field": "last_modify_time",
    "order": 0
}
```

### Response Examples

#### Failure

{% include '_generic_v4_error_resp.md.j2' %}

If paging, sorting, action scope, or business scope is invalid, the HTTP status is 400 and error.code is INVALID_ARGUMENT. If the caller cannot manage the IP whitelist, the HTTP status is 403 and error.code is NO_PERMISSION.

#### Success

```json
# http status=200
{
    "data": {
        "start": 0,
        "length": 10,
        "total": 1,
        "data": [
            {
                "id": 1001,
                "bk_cloud_id": 0,
                "host_list": [
                    {
                        "bk_host_id": 101,
                        "bk_cloud_id": 0,
                        "ip": "127.0.0.1"
                    },
                    {
                        "bk_host_id": 102,
                        "bk_cloud_id": 0,
                        "ip": "127.0.0.2"
                    }
                ],
                "action_scope_list": [
                    "SCRIPT_EXECUTE"
                ],
                "all_scope": false,
                "scope_list": [
                    {
                        "bk_scope_type": "biz",
                        "bk_scope_id": "2",
                        "name": "demo-biz"
                    }
                ],
                "remark": "allow script execute",
                "creator": "admin",
                "create_time": 1735689600000,
                "last_modifier": "admin",
                "last_modify_time": 1735689600000
            }
        ]
    }
}
```

### Response Parameters

{% include '_generic_v4_response.md.j2' %}

#### data

| Field | Type | Description |
|------|------|------|
| start | long | Start offset used by this query |
| length | long | Page size used by this query. 10 when omitted, or the valid value sent by the caller |
| total | long | Total number of matched records |
| data | array | Whitelist records |

##### data[] element

| Field | Type | Description |
|------|------|------|
| id | long | Whitelist record ID |
| bk_cloud_id | long | Summary cloud area ID of the record. When hosts in the same record belong to different cloud areas, use bk_cloud_id of each host in host_list. Omitted when the record has no host |
| host_list | array | Whitelist hosts |
| action_scope_list | array | Action scopes. Allowed values: SCRIPT_EXECUTE (script execution), FILE_DISTRIBUTION (file distribution) |
| all_scope | boolean | Whether the record applies to all businesses. Allowed values: true (all businesses), false (only businesses in scope_list) |
| scope_list | array | Businesses the record applies to. Empty array when all_scope is true |
| remark | string | Remark |
| creator | string | Creator |
| create_time | long | Creation time, Unix timestamp in milliseconds |
| last_modifier | string | Last modifier |
| last_modify_time | long | Last modification time, Unix timestamp in milliseconds |

##### host_list[] element

| Field | Type | Description |
|------|------|------|
| bk_host_id | long | CMDB host ID |
| bk_cloud_id | long | Cloud area ID |
| ip | string | Host IPv4. Omitted when the host has no IPv4 |
| ipv6 | string | Host IPv6. Omitted when the host has no IPv6 |

##### action_scope_list[] element

| Field | Type | Description |
|------|------|------|
| (element) | string | Action scope. Allowed values: SCRIPT_EXECUTE (script execution), FILE_DISTRIBUTION (file distribution) |

##### scope_list[] element

| Field | Type | Description |
|------|------|------|
| bk_scope_type | string | Resource scope type. Allowed values: biz (business), biz_set (business set), tenant_set (tenant set). May be omitted when the business has been deleted |
| bk_scope_id | string | Resource scope ID. May be omitted when the business has been deleted |
| name | string | Name of the business, business set, or tenant set. A placeholder text is returned when the business has been deleted |
